---
// Anatomy of a JWT and why edits break it. Numbers: none beyond the post's.
const W = 900, H = 345;
---
<figure class="bep7j">
  <div class="bep7j-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Top: a JWT is three chunks, header, payload and signature, and the signature covers the first two. Middle: the payload is edited to sub admin while the old signature is kept, so the signature no longer matches and the guard answers 401 invalid token, drawn in red. Bottom: an alg none token claims it needs no signature; the guard pins algorithms, so it also answers 401 invalid token.">
    <text x="40" y="34" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>A JWT: three chunks joined by dots</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một JWT: ba đoạn nối bằng dấu chấm</tspan></text>
    <rect x="40" y="50" width="170" height="52" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="125" y="82" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>header</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>header</tspan></text>
    <rect x="230" y="50" width="250" height="52" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="355" y="82" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>payload (claims)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>payload (claims)</tspan></text>
    <rect x="500" y="50" width="230" height="52" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="615" y="82" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>signature</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>signature</tspan></text>
    <path d="M 125 112 L 125 124 L 615 124 L 615 112" fill="none" class="ln" />
    <text x="370" y="144" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>the signature covers header and payload</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>signature bao phủ header và payload</tspan></text>

    <text x="40" y="192" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>Tampered payload</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Sửa payload</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="212" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>sub edited to admin, old signature kept</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>sửa sub thành admin, giữ signature cũ</tspan></text>
    <line x1="400" y1="200" x2="560" y2="200" class="bad" /><polygon points="570,200 560,195 560,205" class="badhd" />
    <rect x="580" y="176" width="280" height="48" rx="8" class="badbox" />
    <text x="595" y="205" class="rd"><tspan data-lang-en>401 invalid token</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>401 invalid token</tspan></text>

    <text x="40" y="272" class="nm">alg=none</text>
    <text x="40" y="292" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>claims it needs no signature</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tự nhận không cần signature</tspan></text>
    <line x1="400" y1="280" x2="560" y2="280" class="ln" /><polygon points="570,280 560,275 560,285" class="hd" />
    <rect x="580" y="256" width="280" height="48" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="595" y="285" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>401 invalid token</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>401 invalid token</tspan></text>
    <text x="580" y="326" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>algorithms=[ALGORITHM] is pinned by the app</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>app cố định algorithms=[ALGORITHM]</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Change any byte the signature covers and verification fails. A token cannot choose to skip verification.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Đổi bất kỳ byte nào mà signature bao phủ thì xác minh thất bại. Token không thể tự chọn bỏ qua xác minh.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep7j { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep7j-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep7j svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bep7j text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .bep7j .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep7j .sub { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep7j .mono { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
  .bep7j .big { font-size: 40px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep7j .rd { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep7j .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep7j .badbox { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .bep7j .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep7j .bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 3; }
  .bep7j .dot { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep7j .baddot { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep7j .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep7j .badhd { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep7j figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
